    <desc>Classic Harrison East–Shovel–Kookipi–Nahatlatch line; repairs, deactivation and recurring rockfall make through travel unreliable. Coarse corridor geometry; not a turn-by-turn track. Verify land access, closures, gates, weather and field signage.</desc>
